s for nicotine. As people encounter more hassles, their bodies react by triggering a desire for cigarettes to quickly relieve stress and restore emotional balance.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.002376374890654595, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7224577678045985, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.00045109439195933616, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3189083972966309}

