ods games, can increase awareness of others' needs and societal problems, which may heighten an individual's sense of responsibility and stress. Therefore, the more someone acts prosocially, the more stress they might perceive due to increased empathy and concern for group outcomes.", 'judge_min_prob': 0.003097719389766062, 'original_polarity': 'NEGATIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6963000526189131, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0008551813431899268, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3009859661420573}

