bit the breakdown of fat, leading to weight gain and a higher BMI.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.0492507638236693, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.776598953675122, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0017988661703017452, 'judge_prob_std': 0.29328465205965776}

