g depressive symptoms can decrease loneliness by promoting social interaction. There are no mediating variables in the CLD that fully explain this direct relationship.', 'prob_std': 0.26374927614216126, 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_motivation', 'judge_verdict': 'PARTIALLY_CORRECT', 'perplexity': 1.4065587966897917, 'max_window_entropy': 1.0807064163258353}

