ense of responsibility and stress. Therefore, the more someone acts prosocially, the more stress they might perceive due to increased empathy and concern for group outcomes.", 'judge_min_prob': 0.005609675814605852, 'original_polarity': 'NEGATIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6952392934810777, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.000935784634680357, 'judge_prob_std': 0.31418632028861965}

